itle>Mitti</title><desc>Deva, a villager, goes on a violent rampage to avenge his sister's rape, and soon finds himself battling both the criminals responsible and the police.</desc><date>20260804</date><icon src="https://xstreamcp-assets-msp.streamready.in/assets/RUNNTV/PROGRAM/6a70851ae1348130a77b4b9c/images/LANDSCAPE_169/87dc5517-47ff-492a-aed8-d9485e0c717a.jpg" /></programme><programme channel="RUNNTV_LIVECHANNEL_40" start="20260804035145 +0000" stop="20260804061226 +0000" catchup-id="RUNNTV_PROGRAM_40_1785815505000_1785823946000"><title>C Kkompany</title><desc>A comedy film about three friends who start a fictitious company called C Kkompany to extort money from the corrupt people in their neighborhood. However, their plan backfires when the news of their company spreads like wildfire, and they become the talk of the town. The movie showcases the hilarious consequences of their actions and how they try to redeem themselves in front of the public.</desc><date>20260804</date><icon src="https://xstreamcp-assets-msp.streamready.in/assets/RUNNTV/PROGRAM/6a70851ae1348130a77b4ba1/images/LANDSCAPE_169/662043e7-6e90-42d2-8ceb-bcd9036b7275.png" /></programme><programme channel="RUNNTV_LIVECHANNEL_40" start="20260804061226 +0000" stop="20260804085216 +0000" catchup-id="RUNNTV_PROGRAM_40_1785823946000_1785833536000"><title>Hogi Pyar Ki Jeet</title><desc>Two brothers reunite in order to fulfil the wish of their dying father whom Thakur bitterly humiliates and murders. They intend to marry Thakur's two daughters to seek revenge.</desc><date>20260804</date><icon src="https://xstreamcp-assets-msp.streamready.in/assets/RUNNTV/PROGRAM/6a70851ae1348130a77b4ba3/images/LANDSCAPE_169/da1b4bad-815a-4178-b075-ad191be756d9.png" /></programme><programme channel="RUNNTV_LIVECHANNEL_40" start="20260804085217 +0000" stop="20260804111909 +0000" catchup-id="RUNNTV_PROGRAM_40_1785833537000_1785842349000"><title>Gandhi My Father</title><desc>The turbulent and troubled life of Gandhi's son, Har